WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.433 --> 00:00:03.036
- [laughing]
COOLIO, MAN.

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.637
OH, YEAH, "SOITAINLY."

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.639
OH, HEY,
I GOTTA GO.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.374
YEAH, TERRY OUT.

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:10.009
- TERRY,
HOW YOU DOING, MAN?

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:11.577
- HEY, PRETTY GOOD,
GABE.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.080
OH, GOT SOMETHING
ON YOUR SHIRT.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.982
- NOT TODAY, TERRY.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:23.523
- LOOKS LIKE GABE'S
COME OUT TO PLAY.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.291
YOU DO HAVE SOMETHING
ON YOUR SHIRT, DUDE.

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.293
- NO, I DON'T.
- YEAH, YOU KIND OF DO.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:28.795
- NO, I'M PRETTY SURE I DON'T.
- GOT A CLEAN SHIRT AT MY DESK

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.329
IF YOU WANT ME
TO GET IT FOR YOU.

00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:31.898
- DON'T SEE WHY
THAT WOULD BE NECESSARY.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.433
- BECAUSE THE SHIRT
YOU HAVE ON RIGHT NOW,

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:34.901
IT'S NOT CLEAN.
- EXCEPT FOR THAT IT IS.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.569
- ME, I HAVE A CLEAN SHIRT.
- OH.

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.237
- YOU, YOU HAVE SOME SCHMUTZ
ON YOUR JAMMY-JAM.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:42.208
- NO, THERE IS NO SCHMUTZ
ON MY JAMMY-JAM.

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:44.644
- YOKNOW WHAT?
WHY DON'T I JUST GET IT FOR YOU?

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.413
- YEAH, WHY DON'T YOU DO THAT?
- YEAH.

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:51.617
AND THERE WE GO.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.620
- DID YOU GET IT?

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:57.990
- [laughing]

00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:00.226
I ALMOST GOT YOU.

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:02.528
I WAS THAT CLOSE.
- ALMOST, YEAH.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:04.931
- I MEAN, I'M THINKING,
"DAMN, HE'S GOOD."

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.466
[both laughing]

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:07.934
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT
THE FUNNY THING IS?

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.135
- WHAT'S WHAT?

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:11.104
- NOW I GUESS FROM WHEN I DABBED

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.705
YOUR SHIRT
WITH THE PAPER TOWEL,

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:15.108
AND I'M NOT PLAYING
THE GAME RIGHT NOW,

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.043
BUT I ACTUALLY--I MUST HAVE GOT
SOME PAPER-TOWEL FUZZ

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.312
ON YOUR SHIRT, SO...

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:22.215
[dramatic music]

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:31.390
♪ ♪

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:34.160
- HEY, HOW LONG HAS KAREN BEEN
WEARING HER HAIR UP LIKE THAT?

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.209
- I DON'T WANT YOU
TO HAVE TO GO THROUGH THAT.

00:02:23.242 --> 00:02:25.111
AND I'M SORRY
IT HAPPENED.

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:27.780
- HEY, TERRY,
WHAT'S GOING ON?

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:30.416
- UH, NOTHINING.
- HAVING A GOOD MORNING?

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:31.884
- YE--
- I'M HAVING A [bleep]

00:02:31.917 --> 00:02:33.619
TERRIFIC MORNING.

00:02:33.652 --> 00:02:35.755
- GREAT.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.356
- HOPE THERE IS NOTHING
ON MY SHIRT.

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:40.693
'CAUSE
I CAN'T LOOK DOWN.

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:45.198
- OH, NO, DUDE, WE'RE NOT DOING
THAT RIGHT NOW, OKAY?

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.599
THERE'S NOTHING
ON YOUR SHIRT.

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:47.934
NO ONE CARES
ABOUT YOUR SHIRT.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:50.102
EVERYTHING'S NOT
ABOUT YOU.

00:02:50.135 --> 00:02:51.938
I'M TRYING TO HAVE
A CONVERSATION

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.673
WITH KAREN RIGHT NOW, SO...

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:03.349
- YOU OKAY, TERRY?
- IT JUST PISSES ME OFF.

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:14.060
[cell phone vibrates]

00:03:30.075 --> 00:03:32.679
- [screams]

00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:41.153
I GOT IT. I GOT IT.
THERE'S NO WAY--

00:03:41.186 --> 00:03:43.522
OH, YEAH, YEAH,
I DO HAVE SCHMUTZ.

00:03:43.555 --> 00:03:46.158
THERE'S SCHMUTZ
ALL OVER ME NOW.

00:03:46.191 --> 00:03:47.727
HE CAN'T DENY THAT.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.328
TERRY'S NOT GOING TO KNOW
WHAT HIT HIM.

00:03:49.361 --> 00:03:51.798
[laughs]
I WILL WIN!

00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:09.215
WHAT--
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:11.651
- TERRY DIED.

00:04:29.101 --> 00:04:31.938
- I'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

00:04:36.608 --> 00:04:39.478
HEY, TERRY.

00:04:39.511 --> 00:04:42.982
IT'S GABE.

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:47.186
I, UM--I JUST WANTED
TO LET YOU KNOW THAT, UM...

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:52.491
THAT YOU DIDN'T GET ME, TERRY.

00:04:52.524 --> 00:04:54.193
YOU DIDN'T GET ME,

00:04:54.226 --> 00:04:55.961
BECAUSE ON THE DAY
THAT YOU DIED,

00:04:55.994 --> 00:04:58.564
THERE WAS SCHMUTZ
ON MY SHIRT.

00:04:58.597 --> 00:05:00.633
SO GUESS WHO WINS
THE GAME, TERRY.

00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.036
I DO. I WIN.
[laughing]

00:05:04.069 --> 00:05:06.272
YOU LOSE.

00:05:06.305 --> 00:05:09.275
AAH!

00:05:22.087 --> 00:05:25.558
[crying]
OH, TERRY.

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:27.360
HE FLICKED ME.

